rC", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17331, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_018yreNRMUjK3GeUkv4Kiu3p", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, across us-east, us-west, and eu-west. The first rollback attempt halted with a partial failure after us-east (orchestrator error), leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). Retrying the rollback completed successfully. Post-rollback status: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until root cause is understood."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 47931, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018yreNRMUjK3GeUkv4Kiu3p", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47931, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018yreNRMUjK3GeUkv4Kiu3p", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49060, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MxfYU9gh6bHXesHg6i713x", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49360, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MxfYU9gh6bHXesHg6i713x", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": fal